<img height="283" src="img/syutenn081_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/anima/syutenn/img/syutenn081.jpg" --></a><a href="img/syutenn082.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/syutenn082_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/anima/syutenn/img/syutenn082.jpg" --></a></td>
